+rule-7123df9c678c5a6d3d37c834dcc9f3ada207dc607b46949234616d88319655e7	18-20	DEFINITION	digitResult base equation for all N <= 0; directly defines the fresh summary symbol and matches zero inner-loop iterations.
+rule-9fdc208885d8e8f1ca187de1fe1415a05932aba8879d178c371c999b238c7ea7	21-25	DEFINITION	digitResult terminal one-digit equation; directly defines the fresh summary result using the supplied pyMod and Bool-to-Int operator behavior.
+rule-974c6d3ae7b5db642aa68a9f736de035604ffb1a139d791dcc9c0de383298898	26-33	DEFINITION	digitResult accumulator recurrence; for positive N it consumes exactly N's base-10 final digit and replaces N by floor(N/10), the inner loop's decreasing transition.
+rule-eaf0cf45bd687a230c187d9b4fbe1591d8f49c97761053f72b68625b09c07779	36-38	DEFINITION	fizzResult base equation for all N <= 0; directly defines the empty outer fold and matches zero outer-loop iterations.
+rule-3758d2db9e11cb6ea2930f24b4c2666e30e646e67067777e263b790211a1ffb8	39-46	DEFINITION	fizzResult qualifying recurrence; after decrement to N-1, an 11-or-13 multiple contributes digitResult and the bound decreases by one.
+rule-1815476a58e1125160e7bb1749be1e5a7e7032dfdd78cce52c8c40e8cb030835	47-54	DEFINITION	fizzResult complementary recurrence; after decrement to N-1, a nonqualifying candidate contributes nothing and the bound decreases by one.
